<title>USA: Franklin Ophthalmic lands big contract.</title>
<headline>Franklin Ophthalmic lands big contract.</headline>
<dateline>ROMEOVILLE, Ill. 1996-09-30</dateline>
<text>
<p>Franklin Ophthalmic Instruments Co Inc said Monday it won a significant contract for equipment from N.Y.C. Health &amp; Hospital Corp in New York.</p>
<p>Terms were not disclosed.</p>
<p>In addition, it said it recently signed a contract with the University of Kentucky and has recently filled orders with the University of Chicago and University of Iowa.</p>
<p>Franklin sells and services instrumentation used by ophthalmologists, optometrists and medical organizations.</p>
<p>	 -- Chicago newsdesk 312 408-8787</p>
</text>
